%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f235e9a96eb7bbb419458f22113d08f2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lose
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSystem.DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - text: HAHAHA! Magnificent! Absolutely magnificent!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 3
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "And victory is mine! What an unexpected surprise\u2026 for you, naturally!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 2
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Ah, what can I say? The strategy, the talent, the elegance\u2026 Everything
      about me is simply flawless!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 3
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It is no easy feat to achieve such a level of perfection. Fortunately,
      I make it look effortless.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 2
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Darling, it has been a pleasure witnessing your attempt. Truly. You almost
      managed to make me feel something resembling excitement.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 3
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But, of course, greatness always finds a way to prevail
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 2
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Admire me all you want! After all, it's not every day you have the privilege
      of losing to Mammon herself.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 3
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
